```graphql
mutation ResetData {
  movie_upsertMany(data: [
    { id: "uuid-1", title: "Movie 1", genre: "Action" },
    { id: "uuid-2", title: "Movie 2", genre: "Drama" }
  ])
}
```

### Clear All Data

```graphql
mutation ClearMovies {
